{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45148","headline":"冬日送颜延之明府抚州觐叔父 · 皎然","name":"冬日送颜延之明府抚州觐叔父","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"临川千里别，惆怅上津桥。\n日暮人归尽，山空雪未消。\n乡云心渺渺，楚水路遥遥。\n林下方欢会，山中独寂寥。\n天寒惊断鴈，江信望回潮。\n岁晚流芳歇，思君在此宵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45148.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45148","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}